      <li><div><strong>Meet and tour</strong><p>Come to the campus, meet the teachers, see a class in action. If you are not in Hội An yet, we do this on a video call. We will also chat with your child to understand how they learn and where their English is.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Enrollment forms</strong><p>When you are ready, we send the enrollment forms. They gather what we need to get your child's first day right.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Payment and welcome</strong><p>Pay the enrollment fee to hold the place. You get a welcome packet with everything for day one, and we add a name to a class list.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
